WEBVTT

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:07.171
CANDY CANDY

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:15.339
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:16.207 --> 00:00:21.774
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:25.679
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:25.852 --> 00:00:28.955
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:34.057
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:41.329
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:41.726 --> 00:00:47.490
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:47.525 --> 00:00:53.619
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:53.869 --> 00:00:56.399
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:59.716
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:11.472 --> 00:01:15.293
"You are prettier when you're smiling
than when you're crying."

00:01:17.297 --> 00:01:22.611
Who is the boy who appeared before her,
just like in a dream?

00:01:23.377 --> 00:01:30.672
The image of a dreamlike prince has
burned itself deeply into Candy's heart.

00:01:34.255 --> 00:01:38.857
From today, I'll be a princess?

00:01:39.533 --> 00:01:43.611
Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
thank you for everything!

00:01:43.646 --> 00:01:45.736
You're going after all, Candy?

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:50.196
Annie and all of my friends have told
me that I need to find my own happiness.

00:01:50.766 --> 00:01:51.849
That's why I'll...!

00:01:51.884 --> 00:01:53.402
Why so suddenly?

00:01:53.437 --> 00:01:56.131
Why don't we make the sad parting
as short as possible?

00:01:56.649 --> 00:02:01.351
I would like that you don't tell all the
little kids about me leaving to Lakewood.

00:02:01.571 --> 00:02:03.589
You're not even going to say farewell to them?

00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:06.213
I don't want to say farewell to anyone.

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:07.965
Candy...

00:02:14.007 --> 00:02:15.284
Sister Pony?

00:02:15.319 --> 00:02:21.035
Though you're a little tomboyish,
you're so cheerful, caring and gentle.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:25.350
I'll give this to you so that God will hear
my prayers and always look after you.

00:02:29.869 --> 00:02:30.994
What is that?

00:02:31.354 --> 00:02:37.158
Sister Lane wanted to make a brand new pajama
for you; the first one since you were a baby.

00:02:37.193 --> 00:02:39.636
You never had a new pajama...

00:02:40.981 --> 00:02:43.899
Teacher...
I'm not crying!

00:02:44.316 --> 00:02:50.545
Candy, you're a cheerful, strong girl!
You mustn't cry, even in hardest times!

00:02:57.516 --> 00:03:00.651
Patty! From today, entire bed is yours!

00:03:01.098 --> 00:03:04.331
All girls who sleep in this bed
will become beautiful like me!

00:03:07.782 --> 00:03:11.771
John, stay well! You'd better
stop wetting your bed soon!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.707
Sam, don't go around bullying girls!

00:03:17.663 --> 00:03:20.740
Milly, eat all your veggies!

00:03:24.192 --> 00:03:26.083
Thank you, sister Lane.

00:03:30.542 --> 00:03:33.385
I'll go while everyone is still asleep.

00:03:33.961 --> 00:03:37.245
Sister Pony, Sister Lane, please,
don't wake up for me.

00:03:42.824 --> 00:03:45.265
We couldn't sleep, either.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:49.815
Of all the kids, I think that Candy was
the hardest one to let go of...

00:03:51.679 --> 00:03:54.060
She was with us ever since she was a baby.

00:03:55.845 --> 00:03:58.937
That tomboyish girl whom
somebody left at our doorstep.

00:04:01.257 --> 00:04:02.515
Farewell.

00:04:09.967 --> 00:04:12.357
Candy! Candy!

00:04:12.969 --> 00:04:14.157
What's the matter, John?

00:04:14.558 --> 00:04:15.476
Sister Lane!

00:04:16.477 --> 00:04:18.075
Come here!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.286
What happened, John?

00:04:19.855 --> 00:04:21.242
Ta-dah!

00:04:21.422 --> 00:04:23.439
I didn't wet my bed!

00:04:23.474 --> 00:04:24.727
That's incredible, John.

00:04:24.762 --> 00:04:26.067
Where is Candy?

00:04:26.249 --> 00:04:28.854
-Huh?
-Candy!

00:04:29.443 --> 00:04:30.903
She is, well...

00:04:30.938 --> 00:04:35.247
This is the first time I haven't
wet my bed since arriving at Pony's home!

00:04:35.782 --> 00:04:37.453
Candy is nowhere to be found!

00:04:39.085 --> 00:04:40.963
Sister Lane, where is Candy?

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.370
Candy? Candy?

00:04:44.543 --> 00:04:46.672
Candy is.. Candy is - -

00:04:49.728 --> 00:04:52.379
Don't go out dressed like that!
Come back!

00:04:55.505 --> 00:04:57.184
Don't do that, it's dangerous!

00:05:00.073 --> 00:05:01.130
John!

00:05:03.275 --> 00:05:07.421
Candy! Candy, look at this!

00:05:10.332 --> 00:05:13.302
I didn't wet my bed!
Hey!

00:05:13.337 --> 00:05:15.697
But... Candy, that's not fair!
Don't you want to know about this?!

00:05:22.121 --> 00:05:23.126
Candy!

00:05:25.476 --> 00:05:28.089
Candy!

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:39.231
Stay well.
Find your happiness.

00:05:57.524 --> 00:06:00.250
Kurin!
It's you, Kurin!

00:06:02.132 --> 00:06:05.443
You didn't have to come all this way!

00:06:06.167 --> 00:06:09.265
I'm sorry, but I don't think I
can take you to Lakewood.

00:06:10.722 --> 00:06:11.993
Now, go back.

00:06:17.698 --> 00:06:19.229
You mustn't follow me!

00:06:21.613 --> 00:06:23.371
Aww, come on...

00:06:24.938 --> 00:06:28.620
Can't help it then.
Look, a mountain of carrots!

00:06:29.735 --> 00:06:30.801
Now's the chance!

00:06:44.766 --> 00:06:46.654
I'm too tired for this.

00:06:47.844 --> 00:06:49.006
Kurin!

00:06:52.915 --> 00:06:54.318
I give up.

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.571
Alright then.
You can come with me.

00:07:00.587 --> 00:07:02.215
Kurin, you!

00:07:07.711 --> 00:07:10.863
Excuse me, can you please
take me to Lakewood?

00:07:11.441 --> 00:07:12.719
I was talking to you!

00:07:14.859 --> 00:07:15.813
Please!

00:07:15.909 --> 00:07:17.212
No good...

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.208
Who...! What are you doing?

00:07:23.348 --> 00:07:24.559
Hey, Candy!

00:07:24.656 --> 00:07:26.713
Tom! It's you, Tom!

00:07:29.242 --> 00:07:31.676
What do you think of my son, Candy?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.534
You've been doing well ever since
you left Pony's home.

00:07:35.569 --> 00:07:38.452
Now I'm much better with
lasso than you are!

00:07:38.487 --> 00:07:39.465
I wonder if it's true!

00:07:39.682 --> 00:07:42.161
That's right, Tom, why don't you
try out against her?

00:07:42.357 --> 00:07:43.463
Alright!

00:07:46.156 --> 00:07:48.354
Candy, do you see that three?

00:07:48.389 --> 00:07:50.111
A blind man could see it!

00:07:50.146 --> 00:07:51.627
Well, Candy, want to try out?

00:07:58.542 --> 00:08:00.816
Damn it, this light is deceiving!

00:08:00.851 --> 00:08:02.747
Making excuses, that's
not like you, Candy!

00:08:03.097 --> 00:08:04.139
Okay, look at this.

00:08:14.278 --> 00:08:16.318
That's incredible, Tom!

00:08:17.325 --> 00:08:21.079
You know, I always thought about your
skill with lasso, so I did my best!

00:08:21.274 --> 00:08:24.648
So that's how it was...!
Teacher is pleased!

00:08:26.206 --> 00:08:27.207
That's a good one!

00:08:28.795 --> 00:08:31.966
So that's how it is... You're going
to become a princess, just like Annie.

00:08:32.001 --> 00:08:33.917
I'll always stay Candy!

00:08:34.926 --> 00:08:37.724
It would be better if you lived
at an ordinary farm, like me.

00:08:37.759 --> 00:08:38.672
Why?

00:08:39.028 --> 00:08:43.156
If you become like Annie, I wouldn't be able
to play with you, or even say "hello" to you.

00:08:43.344 --> 00:08:48.832
Come on, you could always come to play!
As soon as I arrive to Leagans in Lakewood.

00:08:49.386 --> 00:08:50.965
Leagan family of Lakewood?

00:08:51.496 --> 00:08:52.588
You know them?

00:08:52.777 --> 00:08:54.736
I heard about them.

00:08:55.503 --> 00:08:59.104
The Leagan family. A good girl like Candy
would better have nothing to do with them.

00:08:59.498 --> 00:09:01.925
-Well then! Take care, Candy!
-Tom, you too!

00:09:02.293 --> 00:09:03.831
Thank you very much!

00:09:04.807 --> 00:09:06.716
Candy! Hold on a second.

00:09:10.897 --> 00:09:15.144
Candy, there all kinds of things
in this world.

00:09:15.343 --> 00:09:19.003
It may not all be fun and games,
like in Pony's home.

00:09:19.603 --> 00:09:23.097
Life might bring you bad things, too.
Yet, you must never give up.

00:09:23.509 --> 00:09:24.393
I won't.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:28.876
Try to stay cheerful, tomboyish and
always keep your spirits up.

00:09:29.085 --> 00:09:32.103
Regardless of what happens, you mustn't cry.
You understand?

00:09:33.414 --> 00:09:36.104
Mr. Steve, you've said the same thing
as sister Pony!

00:09:36.139 --> 00:09:38.961
Sister Pony?
I see.

00:09:39.162 --> 00:09:44.281
Sister Pony said the same thing!
Take care, then! Do your best!

00:09:44.316 --> 00:09:46.080
Mr. Steve, you too!

00:09:46.115 --> 00:09:48.214
Thanks.
See you again!

00:09:48.398 --> 00:09:49.480
Farewell.

00:09:51.908 --> 00:09:55.280
Candy, farewell!

00:09:55.466 --> 00:09:57.471
Farewell! Oh, no!

00:09:57.506 --> 00:09:59.406
Tom! Your lasso!

00:09:59.441 --> 00:10:03.763
Keep it!
Just in case somebody is mean to you!

00:10:04.092 --> 00:10:05.508
Thanks!

00:10:08.277 --> 00:10:09.565
Let's go, Kurin.

00:10:10.186 --> 00:10:13.271
I wonder what kind of house they have.
I'm so impatient.

00:10:13.865 --> 00:10:15.649
Kurin, let's make a run for it!

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:31.656
Wow, what an incredible house!

00:10:37.556 --> 00:10:40.104
This house looks like it
came from a fairy tale!

00:10:42.131 --> 00:10:44.489
I'm sure the Prince is living here!

00:10:44.889 --> 00:10:46.197
Kurin, let's go in.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:47.801
Excuse me!

00:10:53.958 --> 00:10:55.741
Why, you!

00:10:59.571 --> 00:11:01.275
Now you've done it!

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:11.177
You like this?

00:11:12.081 --> 00:11:13.656
It hurts! Stop!

00:11:13.717 --> 00:11:16.854
I'm going to pull you down here
unless you apologize!

00:11:17.435 --> 00:11:20.459
It hurts! I'll fall!
Help me, mohter!

00:11:20.494 --> 00:11:22.046
Mother! Mother!

00:11:22.835 --> 00:11:24.386
What's up with this noise?

00:11:26.613 --> 00:11:28.287
What are you doing to my son?

00:11:28.455 --> 00:11:31.869
Nice to meet you! I'm Candice White
from Pony's home.

00:11:36.214 --> 00:11:43.398
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Way to make a first impression, Candy.

00:11:44.053 --> 00:11:45.390
This is mistress.

00:11:45.622 --> 00:11:49.810
This is miss Eliza.
And this is the son, Neil.

00:11:51.486 --> 00:11:53.244
And.. are there any others?

00:11:53.279 --> 00:11:55.250
Only Mr. Leagan.

00:11:55.421 --> 00:11:57.801
That's weird, I thought that there
was someone else...

00:11:58.597 --> 00:12:03.125
A prince... no, I mean, someone a bit older
than Neil, but he's good with bagpipes and...

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.676
Don't relate to me so easily!

00:12:06.132 --> 00:12:11.297
Mother, has this girl gone crazy?
Rambling about a prince with bagpipes...

00:12:12.909 --> 00:12:14.405
I'm scared!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:17.387
It's okay, Kurin.
Eliza, you coward!

00:12:17.588 --> 00:12:19.289
And now she's talking to me!

00:12:19.324 --> 00:12:24.568
Candy, you're supposed to relate to
Eliza as "miss", and to Neil as "mister".

00:12:26.553 --> 00:12:30.326
In this house, even siblings are relating
to each other with "mister" and "miss"?

00:12:30.522 --> 00:12:33.481
Our sibling?!
This tramp?

00:12:33.516 --> 00:12:35.232
That's a good joke!

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.525
Stewart, what have you told Candy?

00:12:41.442 --> 00:12:44.454
I brought her for the daughter of the
Leagan family. That's what I told her.

00:12:45.456 --> 00:12:48.664
From today, I'll let you live here like a
daughter, and I'll let you go anywhere...

00:12:49.971 --> 00:12:51.441
Just like...?

00:12:51.476 --> 00:12:55.415
However, I don't want you to think that
Eliza and Neil are your siblings.

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.744
Then I...

00:12:56.922 --> 00:12:59.252
You are to become Eliza's playmate.

00:12:59.439 --> 00:13:01.678
I don't want a playmate!

00:13:01.713 --> 00:13:03.246
Father decided upon this.

00:13:04.014 --> 00:13:06.785
Stewart, I'm going out.
Prepare the car!

00:13:06.847 --> 00:13:08.067
Yes, madam.

00:13:09.247 --> 00:13:10.930
Let's go, brother.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:15.301
Now that was a scare! Just to
think of her as our sibling!

00:13:21.784 --> 00:13:26.944
Kurin, what should I think now that madam
said that I'm not to become their sibling?

00:13:26.979 --> 00:13:29.365
I am still going to be without parents?

00:13:30.219 --> 00:13:32.712
And this is not wandering prince's house.

00:13:33.103 --> 00:13:34.161
This is bad.

00:13:45.665 --> 00:13:47.463
I've prepared a room for you.

00:13:47.857 --> 00:13:50.060
Hello! I'm Candy!

00:13:50.272 --> 00:13:51.873
My name is Dorothy.

00:13:52.256 --> 00:13:53.409
Let's be friends!

00:13:53.444 --> 00:13:54.239
Okay.

00:13:56.459 --> 00:13:57.873
Please, come this way.

00:13:59.078 --> 00:14:02.129
It's in the attic, not exactly the
prettiest room around here...

00:14:05.158 --> 00:14:07.286
Got it? Go there and jump
on Candy's face!

00:14:08.953 --> 00:14:10.493
Look out!

00:14:14.509 --> 00:14:17.523
Dorothy!
Are you okay?

00:14:17.728 --> 00:14:19.308
I'm okay!

00:14:21.421 --> 00:14:23.330
Hey, both of you!

00:14:26.464 --> 00:14:27.689
What's this?

00:14:28.084 --> 00:14:30.012
What are you doing to my pajama?

00:14:30.185 --> 00:14:31.535
You call this a pajama?

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:33.109
I thought it was a rag!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.081
Let's see what it can do!

00:14:36.451 --> 00:14:37.824
Hey, and it's a good rag, too!

00:14:38.249 --> 00:14:40.415
With a pajama that sister Lane made...

00:14:41.007 --> 00:14:42.685
I could wipe my shoes with it, too.

00:14:42.948 --> 00:14:44.170
What are you doing?!

00:14:46.127 --> 00:14:47.326
I won't forgive you!

00:14:50.639 --> 00:14:52.242
I won't put up with this anymore!

00:14:53.018 --> 00:14:54.912
Somebody come!
Anybody!

00:14:54.947 --> 00:14:57.217
Eliza! You're gonna get some, too!

00:15:00.804 --> 00:15:02.481
Stop! Please stop!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.664
Help! Somebody!

00:15:05.302 --> 00:15:07.484
Stop that! What are you doing?

00:15:13.922 --> 00:15:16.826
Really. It's not the prettiest room.

00:15:16.861 --> 00:15:21.042
But it's a room, just for me.
Right, Kurin? Isn't it nice?

00:15:21.242 --> 00:15:22.103
Yes!

00:15:22.429 --> 00:15:23.997
Mistress wants to see you.

00:15:25.263 --> 00:15:28.383
It must about this incident today.
She'll punish Eliza and Neal.

00:15:28.924 --> 00:15:30.591
I'll forgive them if they want
to apologize.

00:15:30.626 --> 00:15:32.360
It is YOU who should be apologizing!

00:15:32.395 --> 00:15:33.943
What?!

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:36.465
Or else you're outta here in the morning!

00:15:36.681 --> 00:15:41.020
I'd prefer leaving over having to live
with such horrible people as you!

00:15:41.435 --> 00:15:43.956
What insolence!

00:15:43.991 --> 00:15:44.924
Stop that!

00:15:44.959 --> 00:15:45.737
Darling?

00:15:47.504 --> 00:15:48.689
You're Candy, aren't you?

00:15:49.563 --> 00:15:50.327
Yes.

00:15:51.336 --> 00:15:53.380
I never thought she would cause
so much trouble.

00:15:53.516 --> 00:15:56.199
She is a result of one
of your whimsical decisions?

00:15:56.234 --> 00:15:58.907
Father, Candy is being mean to us!

00:15:58.942 --> 00:16:01.411
Father, she hurt me!

00:16:01.446 --> 00:16:04.611
Neil, aren't you supposed to be a
successor to Leagan family?

00:16:04.646 --> 00:16:05.449
But...

00:16:06.569 --> 00:16:13.513
I brought Candy over because I thought a
strong country girl might get you two in place.

00:16:13.883 --> 00:16:16.774
Hey, the old guy seems to understand!

00:16:16.809 --> 00:16:18.404
What do you mean by "old guy...?"

00:16:18.604 --> 00:16:21.892
Nah, it's okay.
By the way, Neil, what was that all about?

00:16:21.927 --> 00:16:28.152
I was chasing a cat that got away, and the
cat jumped on Dorothy and she fell...

00:16:28.187 --> 00:16:29.667
You threw the cat on purpose!

00:16:29.877 --> 00:16:33.636
That means that Dorothy was the one in danger.
What do you have to say about it?

00:16:34.656 --> 00:16:36.557
Answer me!

00:16:36.757 --> 00:16:37.910
Yes!

00:16:38.442 --> 00:16:41.456
Nah, it's okay. Candy, just let it go.

00:16:41.674 --> 00:16:42.565
Darling!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.812
I'm going to my study.

00:16:45.073 --> 00:16:47.150
When is he going to stop
running away like that?

00:16:48.554 --> 00:16:51.906
Mother, Neil still hasn't received
an apology from Candy!

00:16:52.089 --> 00:16:53.346
That's right!

00:16:54.544 --> 00:16:57.758
Candy, apologize to Neil and Eliza.

00:16:57.793 --> 00:16:58.883
I won't.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:03.125
You've teamed up with staff in order
to attack Neil!

00:17:03.512 --> 00:17:05.384
I am absolutely not going to apologize.

00:17:06.708 --> 00:17:07.968
Is that so?

00:17:08.003 --> 00:17:12.524
If I can't make you apologize to Neil,
I'll have to make Dorothy leave instead.

00:17:13.521 --> 00:17:16.747
But... Dorothy has nothing
to do with this!

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.448
Dorothy, do you think
you are not involved in this?

00:17:20.135 --> 00:17:21.307
Well then?

00:17:26.704 --> 00:17:29.740
Candy, are you trying to
get Dorothy fired?

00:17:29.775 --> 00:17:31.378
That's right, Candy!

00:17:39.283 --> 00:17:42.698
Unless I apologize,
they'll throw Dorothy out.

00:17:44.797 --> 00:17:46.498
Well then, Candy?

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:50.349
I'm sorry.

00:17:52.378 --> 00:17:55.897
-You said something?
-I didn't hear any of it!

00:17:56.955 --> 00:18:00.203
Candy, you're supposed to
apologize on your knees.

00:18:11.396 --> 00:18:17.217
You haven't apologized unless you say
"Forgive me, I was wrong."

00:18:17.393 --> 00:18:20.224
Forgive me, I was wrong.

00:18:20.463 --> 00:18:22.059
Say it louder!

00:18:23.041 --> 00:18:25.843
Forgive me, I was wrong!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.167
Louder!

00:18:29.005 --> 00:18:31.122
Forgive me, I was wrong!

00:18:37.742 --> 00:18:43.236
Tom and Annie, everybody told me to
become happy. I said that, too.

00:18:44.103 --> 00:18:46.211
Teacher, I won't cry.

00:18:46.492 --> 00:18:53.480
Candy, you're a cheerful, strong girl!
You mustn't cry, even in hardest times!

00:18:53.515 --> 00:18:57.804
Try to stay cheerful, tomboyish and
always keep your spirits up.

00:19:00.913 --> 00:19:01.935
You mustn't cry.

00:19:22.454 --> 00:19:26.169
I mustn't cry!
I mustn't cry!

00:19:26.894 --> 00:19:29.383
Because I promised everybody...

00:19:34.294 --> 00:19:35.420
Dorothy?

00:19:35.879 --> 00:19:37.623
Thank you very much!

00:19:38.041 --> 00:19:40.824
Dorothy, you're unhappy here, too?

00:19:41.036 --> 00:19:47.784
Whenever I'm sad, I just think
of my little sisters and brothers.

00:19:48.006 --> 00:19:49.345
Your brothers and sisters?

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:52.379
I have eight of them!
When I think about them,

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:55.503
...any sadness I might have felt
disappears magically in a moment.

00:19:55.997 --> 00:19:58.368
Little brothers and sisters...

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:08.920
Really. I feel better somehow!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.851
Really?

00:20:11.483 --> 00:20:12.820
Yeah.

00:20:17.475 --> 00:20:19.988
Kurin, don't blow up the dust.

00:20:25.561 --> 00:20:26.984
The prince!

00:20:27.665 --> 00:20:30.578
Dorothy, who is he?

00:20:30.753 --> 00:20:33.635
I saw him on the premises a few times.

00:20:34.418 --> 00:20:36.103
He visits the Leagans?

00:20:36.138 --> 00:20:36.930
Yes.

00:20:36.965 --> 00:20:38.839
Then, I'll meet him someday.

00:20:38.874 --> 00:20:40.211
He's somebody you know?

00:20:40.394 --> 00:20:42.128
Yeah. A little.

00:20:47.382 --> 00:20:54.432
Sister Pony, sister Lane, for the first time
in my life, I have a room of my own.

00:20:54.854 --> 00:20:56.735
I'm so happy now.

00:20:57.122 --> 00:21:01.422
"You are prettier when you're smiling
than when you're crying."

00:21:06.425 --> 00:21:09.049
A dream prince will soon be next to her.

00:21:09.675 --> 00:21:15.224
If nothing else, she thought that he will
take her away from this pain and sadness.

00:21:34.071 --> 00:21:39.280
To be continued...

00:21:45.937 --> 00:21:53.955
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:21:54.140 --> 00:22:03.183
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:03.581 --> 00:22:11.978
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:22:12.013 --> 00:22:21.204
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:22:21.576 --> 00:22:29.458
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:22:29.670 --> 00:22:40.082
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:22:40.681 --> 00:22:51.059
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.
